Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aurora-wifi-firmware
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: python3, python3-cryptography, util-linux, mount, systemd, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: liblzfse1
Description: Wi-Fi and Bluetooth firmware from the installed macOS (Aurora)
 macOS runs the Wi-Fi and Bluetooth firmware its system volume ships. At every
 boot aurora-wifi-firmware compares the installed macOS's firmware with the
 EFI system partition's and, when macOS has newer firmware, puts it on the
 ESP for the next boot, with a backup. The boot after a change checks that
 the drivers came up with it and puts the previous files back if they did
 not. Nothing is reloaded in the running boot. liblzfse1 reads
 LZFSE-compressed files on the macOS volume.
